Proposition 6.3 and Theorem 6.13 classify Telezentren by their submanifold dimension gamma in {0, 1, ..., n-1}. When two telecentres have equal dimension gamma_1 = gamma_2, the connecting Telezentrale has dimension gamma_1 + 1; when gamma_2 > gamma_1, a (gamma_2 - gamma_1)-parameter family of (gamma_1 + 1)-dimensional Telezentralen foliates a region of dimension gamma_2 + 1.
:::

