</div>

:::

::::

::: {.notes}
Theorem 6.19 proves Heim's principle of Transzendente Telezentralenrelativität using pure category theory: because the Transzendenzsynkolator Gamma_m is a left adjoint (Gamma_m dashv U_{m+1}), it preserves colimits and initial objects, not terminal objects or final coalgebras. Thus the terminal Haupttelezentrum nu T_m of stratum C(m) becomes a non-terminal initial building block (Nebentelezentrum) in C(m+1).
:::

