## §6.3.4: Morse Parity ($\mu \in 2\mathbb{N}$) & Wasserstein *Resynkolation* {.smaller}

<div class="stratum-badge badge-b">STRATUM B: POINCARÉ–HOPF PARITY (THM. 6.20) &amp; KRAMERS RESYNKOLATION (THM. 6.21)</div>

:::: {.columns}

::: {.column width="48%"}

<div class="interactive-panel">
