  </p>
  <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.12fr 0.88fr; gap:8px; align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <div class="slider-row">
        <span style="color:#FFD700;">Attractors <i>c</i><sub>0</sub>:</span>
        <input type="range" id="mp-c0" min="1" max="6" step="1" value="3" oninput="updateMorseParity()">
